<title>AUSTRALIA: Lend Lease, IBM finalise Telstra alliance.</title>
<headline>Lend Lease, IBM finalise Telstra alliance.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property and financial services group Lend Lease Corp Ltd said on Friday it had finalised an agreement with IBM Australia Ltd and state-owned Telstra Corp Ltd to form an information technology and telecommunications alliance.</p>
</text>
